1
00:00:00,611 --> 00:00:04,781
(Sheldon:)Every year, tens of people
around the world are killed by birds.

2
00:00:05,658 --> 00:00:08,448
(Sheldon:)I'm not going to be another statistic.

3
00:00:09,286 --> 00:00:12,076
(Bernadette:)Look how sweet he is.
Come over and say hi.

4
00:00:16,418 --> 00:00:18,918
(Bernadette:)Come on, you can do it.

5
00:00:19,088 --> 00:00:20,168
(Bernadette:)Don't be scared.

6
00:00:24,718 --> 00:00:26,758
(Bernadette:)Oh, just pet the bird, you big baby.

7
00:00:34,562 --> 00:00:35,812
I did it, heh.

8
00:00:37,147 --> 00:00:39,277
(Sheldon:)I actually did it.

9
00:00:39,942 --> 00:00:42,112
(Sheldon:)Okay, now flush him.

10
00:00:44,905 --> 00:00:47,325
(Woman:)So, Leonard, what do you do for fun?

11
00:00:47,491 --> 00:00:49,411
(Leonard:)Um, let's see.

12
00:00:49,618 --> 00:00:51,498
(Leonard:)Hiking.

13
00:00:52,705 --> 00:00:54,625
(Leonard:)Karaoke in Koreatown.

14
00:00:56,041 --> 00:00:58,881
Any Jennifer Anniston movie.

15
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:02,420
- Hey, sorry I ditched you.
- No, it's fine. Ditch away.

